条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["一女子身着一袭淡蓝色的长裙，裙身轻盈飘逸，仿佛融入了水彩画般的朦胧意境。她的裙摆上点缀着斑驳的花纹，如同自然晕染的云雾与花影，透出一种梦幻般的美感。肩部装饰着宽大的白色蕾丝花边，袖子为半透明的长袖设计，精致细腻，增添了几分古典优雅的气息。她头戴一顶由蓝色小花和绿叶编织而成的花冠，花朵清新自然，与周围环境融为一体。女子侧身而立，微微仰起脸庞，目光望向远方，神情宁静而悠然。她手中提着一个白色的小花篮，篮中插着几枝淡紫色与蓝色的花朵，与她的发饰遥相呼应。背景是一片繁茂的绿色藤蔓植物，枝叶间点缀着星星点点的紫色小花，营造出一个宛如童话花园般的静谧氛围。整个画面充满诗意与浪漫，仿佛时间在这一刻悄然停驻。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 224, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 1320, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [472.1689453125, 256.8512878417969], "pos": [-777.2366333007812, -211.33909606933594], "id": 121, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.75", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 44}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [218], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [359.0403137207031, 82], "pos": [-973.902099609375, -423.7397766113281], "widgets_values": ["杂花 Z-Image Turbo.safetensors", 0.8], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 265, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "LoRA名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "label": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "模型强度"}], "flags": {}, "id": 106, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"lora_name": true, "strength_model": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"lora_name": true, "strength_model": true}, "Node name for S&R": "Lor